# DJSCE Campus Placement Portal — API Route ↔ Frontend Mapping

> **Base URL (Backend):** `http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/`  
> **External ATS Service:** `http://127.0.0.1:8081/api/`  
> **Frontend Hook File:** `placement-connect/src/hooks/useApi.ts`  
> **Backend Views File:** `backend/placements/views.py`  
> **Backend URLs File:** `backend/placements/urls.py`

---

## Architecture Overview

```
Frontend (React + Vite)                    Backend (Django REST Framework)
─────────────────────────────              ──────────────────────────────
src/hooks/useApi.ts          ←──── HTTP ────→  placements/views.py
  (React Query wrappers)                         (ModelViewSets)
       │
       ▼
src/pages/**/*.tsx
  (UI pages consume hooks)
```

All API calls are defined as **React Query** hooks in `useApi.ts` and imported by individual pages. There is **no direct `fetch()` in pages**, except for the custom CSV download (opened via `window.open`) and the external ATS ranking call in `RecruiterPostings.tsx`.

---

## 1. Students Endpoint — `/api/students/`

| Method   | Full URL                         | Backend Action       | Hook in `useApi.ts`   |
|----------|----------------------------------|----------------------|-----------------------|
| `GET`    | `/api/students/`                 | List all students    | `useStudents()`       |
| `POST`   | `/api/students/`                 | Create a student     | `useCreateStudent()`  |
| `PATCH`  | `/api/students/{id}/`            | Partial update       | `useUpdateStudent()`  |
| `PUT`    | `/api/students/{id}/`            | Full update (resume) | `useUpdateStudent()`  |

> `useUpdateStudent` uses **PATCH** for JSON profile edits and **PUT** for FormData resume uploads.

### Frontend Pages That Use This Endpoint

| Page File | Route | Hooks Used | Purpose |
|-----------|-------|------------|---------|
| `pages/LoginPage.tsx` | `/` (login dialog) | `useStudents()`, `useCreateStudent()` | Look up student by SAP ID / email for login; create account on registration |
| `pages/student/StudentDashboard.tsx` | `/student` | `useStudents()`, `useJobs()`, `useApplications()` | Display student name and personalized stats |
| `pages/student/StudentProfile.tsx` | `/student/profile` | `useStudents()`, `useUpdateStudent()` | View and edit profile fields; upload resume to Cloudinary |
| `pages/recruiter/RecruiterDashboard.tsx` | `/recruiter` | `useStudents()`, `useJobs()`, `useApplications()` | Build department & CGPA charts from applicant data |
| `pages/recruiter/RecruiterPostings.tsx` | `/recruiter/postings` | `useStudents()`, `useApplications()`, `useJobs()` | Show student details (name, dept, CGPA, SAP ID) alongside each application |
| `pages/coordinator/CoordinatorDashboard.tsx` | `/coordinator` | `useStudents()`, `useJobs()`, `useApplications()` | Portal-wide analytics charts |
| `pages/coordinator/CoordinatorApplications.tsx` | `/coordinator/applications` | `useStudents()`, `useJobs()`, `useApplications()` | Full application table with student info; CSV export |
| `pages/coordinator/CoordinatorStudents.tsx` | `/coordinator/students` | `useStudents()` | Browse/search all registered students |

---

## 2. Jobs Endpoint — `/api/jobs/`

| Method   | Full URL                                        | Backend Action              | Hook in `useApi.ts`  |
|----------|-------------------------------------------------|-----------------------------|----------------------|
| `GET`    | `/api/jobs/`                                    | List all jobs               | `useJobs()`          |
| `POST`   | `/api/jobs/`                                    | Create job + email students | `useCreateJob()`     |
| `GET`    | `/api/jobs/{id}/download_applications/`         | Download applicants CSV     | Direct `window.open` |

> **Side effect on POST:** `JobViewSet.perform_create()` automatically calls `send_job_notification_to_students()` which emails all eligible students (filtered by `eligibleDepartments`) via a background thread.

### Frontend Pages That Use This Endpoint

| Page File | Route | Hooks / Calls Used | Purpose |
|-----------|-------|--------------------|---------|
| `pages/student/StudentDashboard.tsx` | `/student` | `useJobs()` | Show recent active job openings |
| `pages/student/StudentJobs.tsx` | `/student/jobs` | `useJobs()`, `useApplications()`, `useCreateApplication()` | Browse, filter, and apply to jobs |
| `pages/student/StudentApplications.tsx` | `/student/applications` | `useJobs()`, `useApplications()` | Show job details alongside each application |
| `pages/recruiter/RecruiterDashboard.tsx` | `/recruiter` | `useJobs()`, `useApplications()`, `useStudents()` | Filter jobs by `postedBy === userId` for stats |
| `pages/recruiter/RecruiterPostJob.tsx` | `/recruiter/post` | `useCreateJob()` | Submit new job form (JSON or FormData with PDF) |
| `pages/recruiter/RecruiterPostings.tsx` | `/recruiter/postings` | `useJobs()`, `useApplications()`, `useStudents()` | List own posted jobs; trigger CSV download via `window.open` |
| `pages/coordinator/CoordinatorDashboard.tsx` | `/coordinator` | `useJobs()`, `useApplications()`, `useStudents()` | Company-wise application breakdown |
| `pages/coordinator/CoordinatorApplications.tsx` | `/coordinator/applications` | `useJobs()`, `useApplications()`, `useStudents()` | Cross-reference job info for each application row |

---

## 3. Applications Endpoint — `/api/applications/`

| Method   | Full URL                       | Backend Action              | Hook in `useApi.ts`         |
|----------|--------------------------------|-----------------------------|-----------------------------|
| `GET`    | `/api/applications/`           | List all applications       | `useApplications()`         |
| `POST`   | `/api/applications/`           | Submit application          | `useCreateApplication()`    |
| `PATCH`  | `/api/applications/{id}/`      | Update status               | `useUpdateApplication()`    |

> `useCreateApplication` sends **FormData** if a custom resume file is attached, otherwise plain **JSON**.  
> `useUpdateApplication` is used exclusively for status changes (`pending → shortlisted / rejected`).

### Frontend Pages That Use This Endpoint

| Page File | Route | Hooks Used | Purpose |
|-----------|-------|------------|---------|
| `pages/student/StudentDashboard.tsx` | `/student` | `useApplications()` | Count the student's own applications (all, shortlisted, pending) |
| `pages/student/StudentJobs.tsx` | `/student/jobs` | `useApplications()`, `useCreateApplication()` | Check if already applied; submit new application with optional resume + cover note |
| `pages/student/StudentApplications.tsx` | `/student/applications` | `useApplications()`, `useJobs()` | List all of the student's applications with status badges |
| `pages/recruiter/RecruiterDashboard.tsx` | `/recruiter` | `useApplications()`, `useJobs()` | Count applicants for the recruiter's own jobs |
| `pages/recruiter/RecruiterPostings.tsx` | `/recruiter/postings` | `useApplications()`, `useUpdateApplication()` | Show all applicants per job; Shortlist / Reject buttons call PATCH |
| `pages/coordinator/CoordinatorDashboard.tsx` | `/coordinator` | `useApplications()` | Total applications count; accepted (placed) count |
| `pages/coordinator/CoordinatorApplications.tsx` | `/coordinator/applications` | `useApplications()` | Full application table; client-side CSV export |

